What was copied: the problem.md of each test case, unmodified, except that
`massive_parallel_system` (1201 entities) is not included: it is too large for the dense
reference oracle used to derive expectations. Expectations (status, DOF, and for fully
constrained cases the solution reached from the stated guesses) are in expected.json and were
derived with Amalgam's own reference oracle; ezpz's own expected assignments were not used
(Amalgam's arc and tangent models differ, see crates/amg-sketch/src/corpus/ezpz.rs).

Use: read at test time by crates/amg-sketch/src/corpus/ezpz.rs (written for Amalgam). Test
data only; not compiled into or linked with any crate.
